<title>USA: Philadelphia Fed index 13.9 Sept vs 21.5 Aug.</title>
<headline>Philadelphia Fed index 13.9 Sept vs 21.5 Aug.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve Bank of Philadelphia said its diffusion index of business activity in the manufacturing sector fell to 13.9 in September from 21.5 in August.</p>
<p>			     Sept   Drop   Unch   Rise     Aug</p>
<p>Current Conditions     13.9   19.7   46.7   33.6    21.5</p>
<p>New orders		 16.8   22.0   37.8   38.8    22.7</p>
<p>Shipments		  24.1   18.9   38.1   43.0    23.5</p>
<p>Unfilled orders	   2.0   18.0   61.9   20.1     4.2</p>
<p>Delivery time	   - 2.2   17.6   63.0   15.3   - 0.4</p>
<p>Inventories	     -11.5   31.3   48.0   19.8   -25.6</p>
<p>Prices paid		18.0    5.7   70.2   23.7     4.6</p>
<p>Prices received	   4.6    7.8   78.8   12.4   - 3.0</p>
<p>Number of employees     9.5   12.1   62.6   21.6     5.1</p>
<p>Average Workweek	- 1.7   16.2   68.9   14.5     6.3</p>
<p>-- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-869-1660</p>
</text>
